-type/tungsten.html","group":"11 · Type & measure","viewport":"700x280","subtitle":"The licensed display target — NOT web licensed; broadcast tooling uses it via --font-broadcast, the web uses Oswald","name":"Tungsten — on-air only"},{"path":"11-type/type-rules.html","group":"11 · Type & measure","viewport":"700x250","subtitle":"The nine usage rules, and the faces this stack replaced","name":"Type rules & retirements"},{"path":"12-voice/copy-mechanics.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"Mechanics drawn from the brand's own writing","name":"How the copy behaves"},{"path":"12-voice/creed.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"The lines the brand already says about itself — declarative, technical, unhurried","name":"The creed"},{"path":"12-voice/day-statement.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Condensed caps, closing fragment in cyan — born on the broadcast fullscreen header","name":"Two-tone day statement"},{"path":"12-voice/declines.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x260","subtitle":"Restraint is part of the premium — the rally has never needed to shout","name":"What the voice declines"},{"path":"12-voice/display-grammar.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x260","subtitle":"Where writing and design meet — the rules the tokens will implement","name":"Display grammar"},{"path":"12-voice/hosting.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x230","subtitle":"The partner & press register — gratitude opens, service is confident, never servile","name":"How the voice hosts"},{"path":"12-voice/two-voices.html","group":"12 · Voice","viewport":"700x240","subtitle":"Editorial tells the story; Roadbook runs the numbers","name":"The two voices"},{"path":"13-principles/field-floor.html","group":"13 · Principles","viewport":"700x290","subtitle":"Principle 07 made checkable — requirements, not polish; desert sun is the accessibility spec","name":"The field floor"},{"path":"13-principles/glance-story-boar